        "date": "2026-11-10T21:03:55Z"
      },
      "message": "refactor(tools): ship the starter tool catalog as assets/tools/catalog.json\n\nThe 28 starter tools move from a Rust table to a camcraft-tools/1 JSON\nasset embedded with include_str!; catalog() keeps its contract. The tools\ncrate reads it with a small strict reader (named errors, never a panic);\na test in app pins that parse_tool_library reads the same file identically.\nThe JSON was checked equal to the old table tool for tool before the table\nwas deleted.\n\nFixes #741\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
