        "email": "30616+vilts@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-11-10T22:13:48Z"
      },
      "message": "Merge upstream main into issue/741-tool-catalog-json (tools.rs: torch row moves to the asset)\n\nUpstream's plasma work (#670) added ToolKind::Torch and a PT-KERF-150\nrow to the Rust catalog table this branch replaces with\nassets/tools/catalog.json. The resolution keeps the asset read, adds\nthe torch row to the JSON (torch_tool(1.5)'s values), teaches the\nasset reader the \"torch\" kind, and pins the row against torch_tool(1.5)\nwith the order list grown to 29. .claude/PROCESS_VERSION takes main's.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
